{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_st_16-01","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"st_16-01","title":"庸人的救濟","storyCode":"16-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_16-01.txt","sourceHash":"2be44f74be8265033bf176b3616b0752810b46c044e4378ffd23e400ac716a35","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"最後一位聖愚在狂妄的自辯中走向消亡。多年前，Mantra曾被內衛糾纏。現在，為尋找失聯的Raidian小隊，她與羅德島眾人再度面對內衛留下的痕跡。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯帝國議會</><p=2>1099年秋</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能告訴我，陛下還要放任這場鬧劇到什麼時候？一天、一個月，還是一年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是受夠了，維多利亞人早就學會控制天災了，就連那些蠻荒的魔族都造出了可以在天上飛的戰艦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們，卻要把時間浪費在商議如何處置這個弄臣小丑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人，這是陛下的仁慈……畢竟現在還是有不少民眾相信這個瘋人擁有某種高尚的品德，陛下也願意將這場審判公之於眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"期限是七天，而到剛才為止……已經過去六天又二十一個小時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢——真是愚蠢！難道我們還要繼續忍受這些汙言穢語，指望最後一夜的鐘聲能讓那個小丑清醒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，大人，恐怕是的。不過好消息是，在鐘聲敲響後，帝國議會將在這裡開始投票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恭敬的近侍","speakerId":"avg_npc_1982_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那個時候，您就不必再忍受這一切了。從今往後都不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……我當然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，滾開吧。就算這丑角之死是注定的，在他真正被埋進土裡或者被燒成灰燼之前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都還會是烏薩斯僅存的聖愚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_1981_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我是不是看錯了？好像是近衛軍的制服——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚訝的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他又回來了？才休息了五分鐘……在之前的演講中，他甚至連一口水都沒喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂熱的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後一場演講——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人都注視著一個衣衫襤褸、格格不入的傢伙大步走到議會大廳的中央。\n他背脊挺直，肢體卻鬆弛，臉上看不出任何對將來的擔憂，或為自己的生存而掙扎的痛苦。\n五分鐘前，他才剛在這裡發表了一通演講——關於愛，關於寬恕，關於他如何原諒所有決定殺死他的人。\n六天的遊說已使聽眾都深覺疲憊，而他卻彷彿完全不受影響，只是一抬手，四周就驟然安靜。\n他開口，甚至仍然帶著笑意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我親愛的朋友們，或者視我為敵的人們，相信我們都清楚，這就是最後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因此接下來我不會繼續談論愛是何種情狀，也不會再大聲宣揚我原諒你們將對我施行的所有錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我將談論——將來，一個不識字的盲人眼中的將來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的軍人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……荒謬……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們需牢記，敘述歷史是無上崇高的權力，這樣的權力同樣容易令人盲目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"二十年來，陛下將他的榮光與萬民分享，他的子民卻沒有做好準備以迎接福澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從不質疑陛下的仁慈，但是不合時宜的仁慈堪比毒藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叛亂的集團軍和北原的感染者，無疑都證明了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卑劣者昂起叛逆的頭顱，將他們骯髒的血塗抹在神聖的土地上；狂妄的學者宣稱掌握真理，有害的言論如毒蟲啃食無辜的心靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無知的傲慢瘋狂滋長，讓人民忘記謙卑，讓帝國忘記慈愛。偉大的帝國與她的子民離心離德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到過去與將來——並非因為智慧，我只是一個愚人，可是未來的走向早已寫在過去的車轍中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我絲毫不後悔宣揚我見到的那個將來，哪怕這是將我送上審判台的緣由，我也不得不繼續宣揚我看到的預言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了烏薩斯的終局，我看到了一個偉大帝國的陷落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"於是今天我站在這裡，我懇請陛下，去阻止這一切發生。如果這需要用到我不值一提的性命，那就拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要更多的血來洗刷烏薩斯的不潔，我也懇請陛下這麼做——一切都是為了更偉大的事業，為了屬於烏薩斯的永恆榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這場審判後——無論它以怎樣的結果落幕，我都將開始我的聖途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我將一遍又一遍地重申謙卑的美德，試圖以這種方式喚回人心，還有帝國的榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許你們會認為我僭越，但我既不領導軍隊，也不制定律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許你們認為我病入膏肓，但我既非瘋子，亦非狂人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的雙手比流浪者更空，我的穿著比感染者更破。我所做的一切——我的過錯，只是使人看到不同的歷史，傾聽不同的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"使我們不嘗試粉飾痛苦，深埋地底的傳統將再度被發掘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"使我們不嘗試淡化殘酷，沉寂已久的呼喊得以振聾發聵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，也許，也許我們偉大帝國的未來將煥然一新——所有憤怒都趨於平靜，無數罪孽將得到寬恕，而一切痛苦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都會由純潔的忍耐化解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯北原荒野</><p=2>■■■■年</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——跑！快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像其他人那樣，一直往前，不要回頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"絕望的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們跑不掉……我們跑不掉的！就算跑出烏薩斯，也是死路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"絕望的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你呼吸得太用力了，雪會嗆進你的喉嚨——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"血會嗆進他的喉嚨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"咳呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就掙脫出來了？！怎麼——怎麼可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"你很聰明，但還不夠。你先前向我投射的幻景，某種程度上也是你自己的經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你錯在不知道那幻景裡的痛苦對我們來說就像妄圖撬動山峰的羽毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這至少展現了你的能力。你有資格成為“它”的替代品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，我對你們嘗試玩弄邪魔力量的行為一無所知，也不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不是一個邀請，而是最後通牒。在我厭倦前，你當然能從我手中救下他們一次、兩次……甚至三次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在我已經厭倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……別再靠近了，除非你想帶走的只是我的屍體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"你的“聲音”不再穩定，你開始懷疑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"並非聖愚，卻使用它的力量。代價是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"萬事萬物都有代價，你也快接近你的盡頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許，那個盡頭是我們會一起死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你沒有聽見。或者你只是已經沒有多餘的精神去關注更多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有聽見那些雪地上的腳步聲，沒有聽見你就算同歸於盡也想保護的人……只是一群苟且的蟲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"其實他們從來不敢離開故土太遠。說著不願背棄國家，懷揣極度的僥倖，即使逃亡也刻意蹣跚，或是乾脆朝著死亡折返歸來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"因為離開這裡，他們就無法確認自己的存在，即使這存在帶來的只有絕望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，你的告誡全無用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你告訴他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"“不要回頭”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！咳——咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想為烏薩斯帶來一位連身體機能都被破壞殆盡的聖愚，這會浪費很多時間，即使你本身的能力超群也並不划算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我再次建議你選擇放棄掙扎，跟我離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也再說一次，我不知道你說的“聖愚”是什麼，也對成為它毫無興趣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就算我現在和你離開，那感染者呢？那些被你們驅趕的……走投無路的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會有自己的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你必須“說”得更明確一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我必須……"},{"type":"narration","text":"安靜，緊繃，四周皆然。在完整的“話語”自腦海中浮現前，雪依舊飄落，那黑色身軀向前邁步的動作卻凝滯了。\n下一簇新雪尚未觸及大地，漆黑的薄霧已在蔓延。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"他突然失去了繼續前進的意願。剝離了理智的另一半認知，則等待著先前的圖景再度出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"故技重施……"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是沒有。什麼也沒有。\n只有毫無來由的停滯，只有漆黑自他周身不斷散出，從薄霧累積成厚重的塵灰。\n就像下了一場黑色的雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"這是——但我沒有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"我體內的邪魔發生了輕微洩漏，你竟然能利用我的力量，反過來控制我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是讓你困於你體內的穢物包含的……幻影，讓你直視你自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要試圖做無謂的掙扎，否則……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"否則，你就會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你自己的“國度”裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳咳咳！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉睡吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，這、這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子……孩子！你還好嗎？那個黑漆漆的怪物難道還在追我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……咳、咳呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不會……再追你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走，離開這裡，往南去，在他“醒過來”之前。這次真的不能再回頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們必須離開這裡才能活……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您說什麼？他不會再追我們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說，您勸服了不通人情的巫怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"走……走去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"傳道士大人說過，“背棄故土者永不配自稱為人”。我們……我們不願那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不願背棄陛下、背棄烏薩斯，也不願背棄您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"您竟然真能使他不再追來……您救了我們，做到了不可能做到的事，卻還是不願意告訴我們您的名字嗎？請問您到底是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，其實——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"其實您真的就是那位消失已久的聖愚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"但聖愚應該在聖駿堡富麗堂皇的宮殿裡，在陛下的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，沒錯！如果您原本就不屬於這裡，我們只是竊取了這份恩賜，那被懲罰，也是理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們應當忍耐”、“我們應當承受”……“我們應當平靜”！但我們什麼也沒有做到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，您還是庇護了我們這些有罪的靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那您一定就是聖愚。否則，您不會擁有這樣的胸懷，向感染者也伸出援手的、同等的博愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，您的名字就只有可能是那一個了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那個您不願我們稱頌的名字，那個所有聖愚共同擁有的名字——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迦弗里伊爾、迦弗里伊爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是聖愚，是我們的聖愚回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“聖愚”，是故事書裡的那個嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是媽媽說，就算不在我們身邊，就算我們得了石頭病，也會愛著我們的那個嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，是她！她回來了！她屏退了惡人，庇佑了凡人，這都是只有聖愚才能做到的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚拯救了我們，聖愚——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群，吵嚷，無數雙手不斷向她湧來。\n他們攀扯彼此，像潮水陣陣撲向海岸，只為能夠觸及受崇奉者身上的一片衣角，哪怕那只是與他人並無不同的粗布衣衫。\n被包圍的人再也無力支撐，無力思考。抽搐著以膝蓋接觸雪面的那個瞬間，她幾乎就快這樣癱軟在地。\n可是不行。內衛還在這裡，想要利用她去殺死更多人的劊子手還在這裡，她不能閉眼，不能……放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“迦弗里伊爾”？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“迦弗里伊爾”？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——"},{"type":"narration","text":"剎那間她甚至以為自己早已廢棄的舌根再度與口腔共振，真切地發出了聲音，但身體卻只是悄無聲息地蜷縮，直到越來越小，越來越小。\n她忍耐著，等待這痛楚熄滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚——"},{"type":"narration","text":"並非聖愚，卻有代價。\n然而就連被誤認的人本身也不知道這荒謬舉動的代價有多少。也許有時候，“不明代價”，本身就是一種代價。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士？怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"領頭者沉靜的聲音驀地在羅德島眾人的腦海中響起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，停下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重複，所有人立刻停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前方發現邪魔汙染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“邪魔汙染”？在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡不是離薩米還隔著三分之一個烏薩斯嗎？怎麼會有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這恐怕不是普通的邪魔汙染……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“國度”。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北中心礦區</><p=2>1101年秋</>"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Raidian小隊最後的座標就在附近。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據傳回城中據點的訊息標記，Raidian小隊最後一次發出訊息已經是十天之前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她之前提到的那座研究所，就在前方三公里左右的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr，或許你也曾直接面對過內衛？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Mon3tr，你能從這裡分析出什麼嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從汙染的規模和形狀來看，這真的很像是“國度”留下的汙染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，這裡很有可能發生過與內衛的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是很奇怪，發生過這種程度的戰鬥，附近卻沒有留下任何源石技藝的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我知道你在擔心什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是Raidian，她一定會設法留下可供我們解讀的痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這至少說明，這裡發生了足以驚動內衛的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那位女大公顯然對我們還有所隱瞞。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Raidian小隊可能處在極度危險的情況之中。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Raidian小隊可能已經被這裡發生的事波及。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論對方是追著Raidian而去，還是為了研究所而來，我們都必須加快速度了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
